{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>Their pillars, three.</b> Five cubits between pillar and pillar. From the pillar at the south corner — standing at the south-east corner — to the pillar that is one of the three on the east side: five cubits. From it to the second: five cubits. From the second to the third: five cubits. And likewise for the second shoulder. And four pillars for the screen — behold, ten pillars on the east, corresponding to the ten on the west."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:54:56.326249649Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}